# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nikita Nazarov, oscd.community
# Date: 2020-10-08
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1027, attack.execution, attack.t1059.001
# Description: Detects Obfuscated Powershell via use MSHTA in Scripts
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((ScriptBlockText="*set*" AND ScriptBlockText="*&&*" AND ScriptBlockText="*mshta*" AND ScriptBlockText="*vbscript:createobject*" AND ScriptBlockText="*.run*" AND ScriptBlockText="*(window.close)*"))
